  "mailer_subjects_magic_link": "Your OpenClicky code",
  "mailer_templates_magic_link_content": "<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light only\"><title>OpenClicky</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F4F1EA\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">{{ .Token }} is your sign-in code. It works for an hour.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background:#F4F1EA\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#fff;border-radius:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22201C\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 0;font:700 17px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22201C\"><span style=\"color:#F0452B\">●</span>&nbsp;openclicky</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:22px 32px 26px\">\n  <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font:600 22px/1.3 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22201C\">Your sign-in code</h1>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font:16px/24px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Type this into OpenClicky to sign in:</p>\n  <div style=\"margin:0 0 14px;padding:16px 0;background:#F4F1EA;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;font:700 34px/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#22201C\">{{ .Token }}</div>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font:14px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5E5A52\">It works for an hour.</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px 4px;border-top:1px solid #ECE7DC\">\n  <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5E5A52\">Three things to try</p>\n  \n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:0 0 16px\"><tr>\n    <td valign=\"top\" width=\"30\" style=\"font:600 15px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#F0452B\">1</td>\n    <td style=\"font:15px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22201C\"><b>Ask, and it points.</b> Hold <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border:1px solid #ECE7DC;border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;color:#22201C;white-space:nowrap\">⌃ control</span> + <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border:1px solid #ECE7DC;border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;color:#22201C;white-space:nowrap\">⌥ option</span> and ask out loud: <i>“where do I check battery health?”</i> A pointer flies to the answer on your screen.</td>\n  </tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:0 0 16px\"><tr>\n    <td valign=\"top\" width=\"30\" style=\"font:600 15px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#F0452B\">2</td>\n    <td style=\"font:15px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22201C\"><b>Talk instead of typing.</b> Hold <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border:1px solid #ECE7DC;border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;color:#22201C;white-space:nowrap\">fn</span> in any text box, speak, let go. Your words are typed where your cursor is, tidied for the app you're in.</td>\n  </tr></table>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin:0 0 16px\"><tr>\n    <td valign=\"top\" width=\"30\" style=\"font:600 15px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#F0452B\">3</td>\n    <td style=\"font:15px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#22201C\"><b>Rewrite what you wrote.</b> Select some text, hold <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border:1px solid #ECE7DC;border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;color:#22201C;white-space:nowrap\">fn</span> + <span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border:1px solid #ECE7DC;border-bottom-width:2px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;color:#22201C;white-space:nowrap\">⌃</span> and say <i>“make it formal”</i>.</td>\n  </tr></table>\n  <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5E5A52\">On Windows: hold Ctrl + Win to ask, right Ctrl to dictate. On Linux: left Ctrl + Alt to ask, left Ctrl to dictate.</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:20px 32px 28px;border-top:1px solid #ECE7DC;font:14px/22px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5E5A52\">\n  Free and open source. Questions or ideas? Just reply, a person reads every one.<br>\n  <a href=\"https://openclicky.org\" style=\"color:#22201C\">Website</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/zGGERnM5eq\" style=\"color:#22201C\">Discord</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/prasanthsasikumar/openclicky\" style=\"color:#22201C\">GitHub</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font:12px/18px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#5E5A52\">You got this because someone typed this address into OpenClicky.<br>If it wasn't you, ignore it: nothing happens without the code.</p>\n</td></tr></table>\n</body></html>",
